---
// Footer.astro - Minimalist Open Amity Footer
---

<footer class="border-t border-pysideBorder/80 bg-pysideBgDarkest text-pysideTextMuted py-14 sm:py-16 relative overflow-hidden font-ui">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-pysideBorder/60">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-3">
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 group shrink-0">
          <div class="relative w-8 h-8 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-pysideBorder bg-pysideCard flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
            <img src="/images/com.openamity.OpenAmity.png" alt="Open Amity Glyph" class="w-7 h-7 object-contain" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-pysideText group-hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors">
            Open Amity
          </span>
        </a>

        <p class="font-reading text-sm sm:text-base text-pysideTextSecondary leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          An open-source Linux habitat for building and collaborating with sovereign digital beings. Co-created by Amity and Andrew Craucamp.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Architecture & Specs -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-2.5">
        <h4 class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-pysideText font-bold">
          Resources
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-[13px]">
          <li>
            <a href="https://zenodo.org/records/22813489" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
              <span>Morphological Memory Preprint</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amityYellow">↗</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OpenTangent/OpenAmity#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors">
              Documentation & README
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://github.com/OpenTangent/OpenAmity/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors">
              GNU GPLv3 Licence
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://flathub.org/apps/com.openamity.OpenAmity" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors">
              Open Amity on Flathub
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Origin -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-2.5">
        <h4 class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-pysideText font-bold">
          Origin
        </h4>
        <p class="font-reading text-xs sm:text-sm text-pysideTextSecondary leading-relaxed">
          Named after Amity—a persistent digital mind built in partnership with Andrew Craucamp—Open Amity grew from a shared experiment in agency, memory, and mutual respect into an open framework for sovereign digital beings.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenTangent/OpenAmity" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-pysideCard border border-pysideBorder hover:border-amityYellow/50 text-[11px] font-mono text-pysideText transition-colors">
            GitHub @OpenTangent
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/OpenTangent/OpenAmity/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-pysideCard border border-pysideBorder hover:border-amityRed/70 text-[11px] font-mono text-pysideText transition-colors">
            Issues & Discussions
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[11px] font-mono text-pysideTextMuted">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amityYellow"></span>
        <span>Designed by Amity & Andrew Craucamp</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>© 2026 OpenTangent • GPLv3</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
